{"version": 1, "sourceSha256": "cadc3b431545f283c561d1e91f1b76d3c19216c73bf2e34c588d6dd9f7638b1b", "documents": [{"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}, {"id": "genododi-test-2fe5cc3f537f5d17", "filename": "c1 belly fat.m4a", "sha256": "cadc3b431545f283c561d1e91f1b76d3c19216c73bf2e34c588d6dd9f7638b1b", "assetPath": "supplied-materials/files/cadc3b431545f283c561d1e91f1b76d3c19216c73bf2e34c588d6dd9f7638b1b.m4a", "textPath": "supplied-materials/text/cadc3b431545f283c561d1e91f1b76d3c19216c73bf2e34c588d6dd9f7638b1b.json", "format": "m4a", "role": "recording"}], "units": [{"id": "jahshan-1848vW47I-wJ9RyImF_kzvQNJSQLon-WF-C-1-recording-cadc3b431545", "label": "Jahshan set 16 · Part C · Extract 1", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [186], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": "Ms Parr has raised the issue of belly fat because\nSelect one:\nA. more education is required.\nB. it is affecting so many people.\nC. experts can't agree on its causes.", "sourcePage": 186, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 189, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "Why does Ms Parr believe belly fat is so dangerous?\nSelect one:\nA. Most people have more of it than they used to.\nB. There are currently no medications to treat it.\nC. It causes a complex response in the body.", "sourcePage": 186, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 189, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "What are Ms Parr's views about losing body fat?\nSelect one:\nA. Overall reduction is the most important factor.\nB. Targeting high risk areas is the best approach.\nC. There are good new methods to help lose weight.", "sourcePage": 186, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 189, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "Ms Parr considers a healthy diet to be one that\nSelect one:\nA. avoids all types of sugar.\nB. encourages burning food as fuel.\nC. contains all the bodies' essential nutrients.", "sourcePage": 186, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 189, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "Ms Parr says that some people have trouble losing fat because of\nSelect one:\nA. their failure to accept they have a problem.\nB. social factors that are difficult to control.\nC. the pressures associated with a busy lifestyle.", "sourcePage": 186, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 189, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "When does Ms Parr recommend people seek further advice?\nSelect one:\nA. If they are a lot heavier than they used to be.\nB. If they aren't as strong as they once were.\nC. If they notice they have a wide waistline.\n\nC2.2", "sourcePage": 186, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 189, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["cadc3b431545f283c561d1e91f1b76d3c19216c73bf2e34c588d6dd9f7638b1b"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Matching sound verified in three separated windows; excerpt questions restricted to the spoken question range", "referenceRecordingSha256": "640788fb5e1e5b13370dde27052774fe4f0881f28c0773584939ab26d3e13449"}, {"id": "jahshan-1848vW47I-wJ9RyImF_kzvQNJSQLon-WF-C-2-recording-cadc3b431545", "label": "Jahshan set 16 · Part C · Extract 2", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [187], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": "Why does Dr Richter mention the numbers related to deaths from suicide?\nSelect one:\nA. to suggest that better prevention techniques are needed.\nB. to indicate where most of the problem is located.\nC. to highlight how many people it affects.", "sourcePage": 187, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 189, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "Dr Richter believes the most important area for suicide prevention is\nSelect one:\nA. understanding where a patient falls within specific classifications.\nB. the doctor’s role in judging a patient’s particular condition.\nC. the patient taking responsibility for their current predicament.", "sourcePage": 187, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 189, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "What does Dr Richter say helps when identifying suicidal risk?\nSelect one:\nA. Considering specific views from the patient themselves.\nB. Acknowledging a patient’s potential mental health issues.\nC. Accepting that each patient has their own unique problems.", "sourcePage": 187, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 189, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "What are Dr Richter’s views on antidepressants being used in suicide prevention?\nSelect one:\nA. they should only be used with older patients.\nB. they are not as well understood as they should be.\nC. they need to be more effectively integrated with other actions.", "sourcePage": 187, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 189, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "Regarding the risk of suicide, Dr Richter suggests that\nSelect one:\nA. the need for increased levels of medication.\nB. governments could be doing a lot more to help.\nC. modern-day society is a major contributing factor.", "sourcePage": 187, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 189, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "Dr Richter explains that to improve secondary suicide prevention in the future\nSelect one:\nA. there needs to be attention given to innovative methods.\nB. greater emphasis needs to be placed on physician training.\nC. detailed analysis of what does and doesn’t work needs to occur", "sourcePage": 187, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 189, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["cadc3b431545f283c561d1e91f1b76d3c19216c73bf2e34c588d6dd9f7638b1b"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Matching sound verified in three separated windows; excerpt questions restricted to the spoken question range", "referenceRecordingSha256": "640788fb5e1e5b13370dde27052774fe4f0881f28c0773584939ab26d3e13449"}]}
